{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act46side_level_act46side_st01",
  "groupId": "act46side",
  "stageId": "act46side_st01",
  "title": "Landslide",
  "storyCode": "OS-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act46side/level_act46side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "676c1b835988ec6325b38fcbc23dbca98f0f1666ef7bcdc2be5273622cbbff7c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I believe you're wrong, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Victoria may be the strongest nation on Terra, for now, but there is no guarantee that such prosperity will last forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We are all familiar enough with the history of Victoria's four golden decades, nourished by the legacy of Gaul."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Times have changed, however. When Victoria's productivity advantages eroded, and her ambition to expand went unsated, the cracks of internal strife began to emerge beneath the surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The last king attempted to mediate between the factories and the merchants, but failed to propose a new path out of the dilemma."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "His end was inevitable. The same was demonstrated by the coup in Leithanien not long after."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who emerged as the victor of the bloody struggle? No... it has been more than a decade since they hanged the Lord of Lions, but the repercussions of the coup linger to this day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Wheat of Brighton... the River Mersey Incident... have the dukes been able to set aside their conflicts for even a moment this past decade?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone believes they will emerge the better for the struggle. Not one believes they're digging Victoria's grave together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If we do not see change soon, an intensifying civil war will be what defines Victoria in this new era."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Powerful Old Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I heard that a most eloquent young man stole the show today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Powerful Old Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "One would be forgiven for mistaking you for today's headliner."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I meant no offence, Your Grace, Duke of Caster."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I had hoped to make the acquaintance of more people of wisdom at your manor, but I confess I find myself disappointed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you consider yourself worthy of a position as a duke's advisor, or even the Speaker of Parliament, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyone can point out the ills that plague this nation. Curing it, however, calls for the proper means... a stroke of luck, even."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elegant Young Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It seems that I am hardly the one who should be worrying about these things, though. What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I remember your mother... you have inherited none of her humility or courtesy, but all of her boldness and irreverence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Enciodes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You would hardly have found time for a distant relative from a distant land, if I had not caught your attention this way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It was a rather inflammatory speech, but far from being enough to lay a foundation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Many young lads have visited this house intending to make their names amongst the guests, so as to enjoy the adoration of others in high society."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How do I know you are not one of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have little interest in becoming a guest of honor at the banquets of Victorian nobility. I simply bring a modest proposal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The resources of Kjerag and the industry of Caster complement each other perfectly. There is potential for equal cooperation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I am building Kjerag's first transnational trading company, and I would like to extend an invitation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Equal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Equal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In thirty years, the name Kjerag will lie on the lips of all the nations of Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We have nothing to lose, and everything to gain, from cooperation between our two lands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I commend your courage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I doubt you have the means to make such a promise, child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You will assent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As a consummate and visionary politician, you are well aware of the dilemma that Victoria faces... or should I say, the duchy of Caster faces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You would not lightly dismiss any measure that could improve the situation, however slim the chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The fact that I stand before you now is proof enough that I'm worth investing in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Be thankful you are young enough that I can forgive your impudence."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Answer me, then, young visionary, with your wit and guile."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Caster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How does a country that has yet to adopt the Originium circuit plan on becoming a name on the lips of all the nations of Terra?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your doubts are well-founded. Industry and technology are certainly important, but for a nation, there are other things that are even more important."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To be frank, the particular nature of Victorian politics may have clouded your eyes to the potential of a united nation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enciodes",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I believe—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vine-Bead Court Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saintess, it's almost time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have the doctors not found a way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vine-Bead Court Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For years, the finest doctors of Kjerag and Victoria tried everything they could think of to purge the poison from the Great Elder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vine-Bead Court Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In the end, it is not illness that takes him, but time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "May I see him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vine-Bead Court Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vine-Bead Court Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please... deliver him in Kjeragandr's name."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Enya gently pushes the door open.\nThe dying man's chest barely moves as he lies on the bed. He seems to hear the sound and cocks his ear with great effort before opening his mouth meekly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enya... is that you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Great Elder..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are you feeling? Would you like some water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Listen to me, Enya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is your wish?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This day... has been too long in coming..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you think that? This day has been too long in coming..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course not..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You taught me many things."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have done well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I was a poor teacher... a poor elder..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was not even... a pious child of Kjeragandr."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Great Elder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I haven't heard Kjeragandr's voice... for many years..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I prayed day and night... recited the scriptures over and over... but She never answered my call."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was lost... I was afraid..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I had to keep going..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought... if Kjeragandr's will was to protect Her people... it was not against Her will to act in such a way..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wanted to strengthen the Vine-Bead Court's authority... I wanted the hearts of Kjerag to be united and firm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I erred... in many ways..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'One can lie to a man, but no one can deceive Kjeragandr.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She sees all that we do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She knows all our errors, and our repentance."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know... I believed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But a long time passed... and I thought that I had not been punished by Kjeragandr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And so... I stopped believing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Until last night... Kjeragandr came to me in a dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She did not reproach me... She simply walked in front of me, leading me to the lake whose surface was like a mirror..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And She said, 'All the rivers shall converge upon this place...'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And then I knew, my time was up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to repent... I must repent... but it's too late for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tell me... honestly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you still... hear Kjeragandr's voice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop making all that noise, Yucatan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Since when are you as restless as Sciurus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Matriarch... but I just can't help myself at a time like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's nothing I can do for her but pray."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Always so uneasy, you and Sciurus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She is my younger sister, and the future Browntail Matriarch. A little thing like this should be no trouble at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That idiot's in excellent health. You remember how she sneaked out to climb Mount Jungfrau when she was eight, and ended up breaking her leg when she fell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They thought she'd never walk again. In two months, she was running and jumping around like nothing ever happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No one gave it a second thought... are we really sure there were no lingering effects?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No, no, of course there wouldn't be...\nIt was so long ago, and the doctors say she's healthy as a burdenbeast..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But can those Victorian doctors really be trusted? I'll have their heads if anything happens to my stupid sister..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "<i>Gopferdammi...</i> it's been four hours! Why haven't they come out yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Browntail Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Matriarch, report from Captain Monch—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shut up! Don't bother me, whatever it is!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Browntail Guard",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Understood..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "L-Let's take a deep breath, Matriarch..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kjeragandr will protect Rus..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's the gentlest woman I've ever met... who would Kjeragandr watch over, if not her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right... you're right..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kjeragandr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "O Kjeragandr... hear my prayer...\nI am hardly the most pious of Kjeragandr's people, but now I muster all my piety, in the hopes that Kjeragandr will grant this one favor.\nIf Clan Browntail must be punished for our past transgressions, then let all that punishment fall upon me.\nI will accept your anger, your wrath.\nBut please... spare my foolish sister..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ratatos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By Kjeragandr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dear travelers, please note that train KT392 departing from Lake Silberneherze bound for Brig Pass will be delayed by one hour due to inclement weather.\nKjerag Rail sincerely apologizes for the inconvenience.\nPlease speak to a staff member at the information desk if you require assistance...\n..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Impatient Tourist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are Victorian trains ever NOT late? Looks like they've rubbed off on Kjerag Rail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leisurely Tourist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just a little wait. Frankly, I'd rather stay here for a while longer than deal with those investors back home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leisurely Tourist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least they have good cystymilk here for free... *burp*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leisurely Tourist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But inclement weather, they say? Doesn't look like it's snowing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Agitated Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
