    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Madam Carolin of Rhine Lab."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know who you are, and what you've done. Come quietly, unless you want everyone under the sun to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Vine-Bead Court will grant you a fair and impartial trial. First, give me what you're holding."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The woman silently clutches the folder in her arms and thinks for a moment before crying out without warning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Run! There's a bomb in the station!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crowded station quickly descends into chaos at the woman's cry.\nThe creator of the chaos once again disappears into the crowd."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Damn..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rus... so glad you're alright..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are they... the children?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Perfectly fine. Your sister's taking care of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rest now, and don't worry about a thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yucatan... there were a few times there I thought I was going to see Kjeragandr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Every little bad thing that I ever did came flashing back before my eyes... even that time when I climbed that tree to steal fowlbeast eggs when I was eight..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What would Kjeragandr punish me for...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She already punished you, remember? That time you spent two months in bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry about it, Rus... we've made it through so much. Now we've got another reason to keep going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We have to see Oak and Berry grow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kjeragandr won't separate us..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yucatan... is it snowing outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's a little cold..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll add some firewood and get you another blanket."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sleep well, Rus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The winter will pass... and we can go see the flowers by the lake when spring comes. All of us, together."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sciurus closes her eyes and falls asleep quietly.\nIt should be a moment of happiness...\nBut Yucatan feels a rock in his heart.\nHe looks outside. The clouds are thick and heavy, but the snow refuses to fall. This kind of weather is rarely seen in Kjerag.\nMaybe we're in for a cold winter this year, Yucatan thinks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When the winter passes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'She is omnipresent, She cannot be sought.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need not question Her existence. She is there when we choose to follow Her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Do you remember this from the scriptures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... this is not how it should be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If She is omnipresent and cannot be sought, then who hears Her will, and who—*cough* *cough*!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You should rest, Great Elder. Don't let yourself suffer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see it, Enya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see unprecedented calamity descending upon Mount Karlan..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see Originium bringing ruin to the land..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see... I see Her abandoning Kjerag!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Caught up in a bout of excitement, the old man stares outside the window, his face warped and twisted, seemingly seething in anger, or engulfed by a terror that defies description.\nHe raises his withered arms, trying to grasp something, only for them to fall back down meekly.\nFinally, he quiets down, as though he has expended the last sliver of strength he had..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Enya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Great Elder..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Enya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Say a prayer for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Great Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The final chapter... of the <i>Kjeragandr...</i>"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have no hope of escape. The people of Kjerag know the wind and snow better than any outsider. Your Arts are not effective here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We don't want to damage our relationship with Rhine Lab. Otherwise, I would keep you here by any means necessary to retrieve the military secrets that you stole."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'm not carrying your military secrets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have no reason to believe you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't understand what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't understand what these data mean..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carolin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long do you think your 'god' will protect you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can't talk your way out of this—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monch",
      "speakerToken": null,
